The card's runtime without what A-NAS does not have: todos, settings, the right-click menu with
its actions, and the menu entry with the chat dialog and hotkeys (entry.ts, menu-actions.ts,
todo-bubble.ts and settings.ts are not vendored). Two pieces of those files are still needed
and are carried over as dsh-pet wrote them: the hover tooltip the menu entry places, and the
menu actions' branch for a named animation, which is how the card plays an anim leaf. The rest
of runtime.ts is unchanged; the props lose the third-party menu items.

